<title>SPAIN: Gas Natural signs contracts.</title>
<headline>Gas Natural signs contracts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gas Natural said on Thursday it had signed contracts with electricity companies Sevillana de Electricidad, Terbesa of Grupo Endesa, Fecsa, Iberdrola and Union Fenosa for the supply of natural gas.</p>
<p>The Gas Natural contracts will total 21 billion therms between the last quarter of this year and December of 1997.</p>
<p>With these contracts five percent of electricity generated in Spain will be from natural gas.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
